        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(browser): add GPT-5.6 Sol model aliases",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add browser-only `gpt-5.6` and `gpt-5.6-sol` aliases, both currently targeting ChatGPT's `GPT-5.6 Sol` entry\n- keep the generic and pinned aliases distinct so the generic mapping can move when ChatGPT introduces a new default\n- navigate through whichever GPT-5.x version submenu is currently visible, then strictly select and verify the inner Sol radio\n- keep verified version evidence authoritative when the localized composer pill only shows an effort such as `极速`; missing or effort-only labels cannot self-verify as GPT-5.6 Sol\n- report `switched` when a target row becomes checked after a click even if React leaves the localized effort pill unchanged\n- reject bare GPT-5.6 aliases in API/multi-model paths while preserving provider-qualified custom-id passthrough\n- keep unknown future variants such as `gpt-5.6-luna` from silently falling back to Sol\n\nFixes #305.\n\nThis complements #304: that PR fixes the unified effort picker, while this PR adds first-class GPT-5.6 version routing and strict model-selection evidence.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `pnpm vitest run tests/browser/modelSelection.test.ts tests/cli/options.test.ts tests/cli/browserConfig.test.ts tests/runOptions.test.ts tests/cli/integrationCli.test.ts` (250 passed)\n- `pnpm check`\n- `env -u ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL pnpm vitest run --exclude tests/browser/profileCopy.test.ts` (142 files / 1,430 tests passed; the excluded test requires system `rsync`, which is not installed in this environment)\n- browser API fail-fast smoke exits 1 with `GPT-5.6 Sol is browser-only today`\n\n## Live browser validation\n\nValidated through signed-in ChatGPT Pro AdsPower profiles:\n\n- English (US):\n  - `--model gpt-5.6` returned `ORACLE_GPT56_EN_ALIAS_OK`\n  - `--model gpt-5.6-sol` returned `ORACLE_GPT56_EN_SOL_OK`\n- Chinese UI, with this PR combined temporarily with #304:\n  - `--model gpt-5.6 --browser-thinking-time extended` returned `ORACLE_GPT56_ZH_EVIDENCE_FIXED_OK`\n  - model evidence is now `requested=GPT-5.6 Sol; resolved=GPT-5.6 Sol; verified=yes`\n  - the effort was independently confirmed as `Thinking time: 高 (already selected)`\n\nNo live test clicked or auto-clicked ChatGPT's \"Answer now\" control.\n",
